### Test Analytics Events
@ClientId=platform-backend
@ClientSecret=nYNwTH09AguPkCyPk6Wt6jW2xgrBXrje
@username=123
@password=123
@gameId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@sessionId=a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
@friendId=aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaa456

### Get access token for user
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/FourteenGames/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{ClientId}}&client_secret={{ClientSecret}}&username={{username}}&password={{password}}&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Test Game Started Event
POST http://localhost:8070/api/analytics/test/game-started?gameId={{$uuid}}&gameName=Chess
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Test Game Ended Event
POST http://localhost:8070/api/analytics/test/game-ended?gameId={{gameId}}&sessionId={{sessionId}}&duration=1800&completed=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Test Purchase Event
POST http://localhost:8070/api/analytics/test/purchase?gameId={{gameId}}&amount=15.99
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Game (triggers gamePage_visit event)
GET http://localhost:8070/api/games/{{gameId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Referer: http://localhost:5173/search

### Register User (triggers user_registered event)
POST http://localhost:8070/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

#### Accept Friend Request (triggers friend_added event)
#PATCH http://localhost:8070/api/user/friends/{{friendId}}/accept
#Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}